<rml>
<head>
	<title>Master Skill Tree Background</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="master_level_band.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Companion of master_level.rml: the part of the tree that must stay UNDER the bottom HUD.
     The original stretches its 428-high background art from power-of-two textures without
     cropping, so the texture's black padding covers the screen from reference y 428 down, with
     the HUD drawn over it. Shown behind the tree (CMasterLevel::SyncBackgroundVisibility()). No
     data model: the band is a fixed fraction of the screen. -->
<body>
	<div id="band"></div>
</body>
</rml>
